    <p class="mt-2.5">
      Welcome to <strong>amitendu.me</strong>, the personal portfolio and engineering blog of <strong>Amitendu Bikash Dhusiya</strong> (ShadowAmitendu). Your privacy is important to me, and this site is designed with transparency and data minimization at its core.
